# jobwatch secrets. Copy to .env (development) or /etc/jobwatch.env (server).
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# NEVER commit the real file. .env is gitignored; /etc/jobwatch.env lives
# outside the repo entirely and should be mode 600, owned by the service user.
#
# Set at least one delivery channel below. Both may be set at once, in which
# case every alert goes to both. With neither, alerts pile up in the outbox and
# fail — nothing is lost, but nothing reaches you either.
#
# Check whatever you configure with:  uv run jobwatch notify-test


# ── Discord ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The fast one: Server Settings → Integrations → Webhooks → New Webhook → Copy
# Webhook URL. A minute to set up, arrives on the phone in seconds.
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=https://discord.com/api/webhooks/000000000000000000/xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx


# ── Email ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The durable one: searchable, archivable, no account to be logged into.
# SMTP_HOST and EMAIL_TO are what turn it on. Without both, email stays off and
# that is not an error.
#
# Gmail (most common) — requires 2-Step Verification on the account, then an App
# Password from https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords. Your normal Google
# password will NOT work; Google rejects it and the SMTP error does not say why.
# Paste the 16 characters with or without the spaces Google displays.
#
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_SECURITY=starttls
# SMTP_USERNAME=you@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASSWORD=abcd efgh ijkl mnop
# EMAIL_FROM=jobwatch <you@gmail.com>
# EMAIL_TO=you@gmail.com
#
# Other providers — only the first two lines differ:
#   Outlook / Microsoft 365   smtp.office365.com    587  starttls
#   Fastmail                  smtp.fastmail.com     465  ssl
#   Amazon SES                email-smtp.<region>.amazonaws.com  587  starttls
#   Local relay               localhost              25  none   (no username)
#
# SMTP_PORT defaults from SMTP_SECURITY (starttls→587, ssl→465, none→25).
# EMAIL_TO takes several addresses separated by commas.
# EMAIL_FROM defaults to SMTP_USERNAME.


# ── Optional ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# healthchecks.io free tier. Pinged at the end of every scheduler tick, but only
# when at least one source succeeded — a process that is alive and failing
# everything must not report healthy.
# HEALTHCHECK_URL=https://hc-ping.com/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# Where the database lives. On the server this belongs outside the repo.
# JOBWATCH_DB=/var/lib/jobwatch/jobs.db

# Point at a config directory other than ./config
# JOBWATCH_CONFIG_DIR=/etc/jobwatch/config
